# Vercel by default excludes any folder literally named "node_modules" from
# static uploads. Expo's web export hashes vector-icon font assets using
# their original node_modules-relative path (which is nested TWO levels deep
# here: assets/node_modules/expo/node_modules/@expo/vector-icons/...), so
# both "node_modules" segments must be explicitly un-ignored. Negating just
# the leaf files isn't enough — gitignore-style matching can't re-include
# content whose parent directory is itself excluded, so the directory entries
# have to be un-ignored too, not just their contents.
# See https://github.com/vercel/vercel/issues/10791
!**/node_modules
!**/node_modules/**
